  "description": "We\u2019re ready to deploy the new API function. The deployment package is **my-function.zip**, and the Lambda handler is defined at **handler.main**. The function will run on the **nodejs18.x** runtime within the AWS\u202fLambda environment, allocated **256\u202fMB** of memory and a timeout of **30\u202fseconds**. Environment variables are set to **ENV=prod** and **DEBUG=false**.\n\nThe function is configured to run in the **us\u2011east\u20111** region as an **API** service, identified by UUID **123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000**. It will be placed in a VPC using the subnet **subnet-0a1b2c3d4e5f6g7h8** and the security group **sg-123abc456def**."
